DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
1680::$$$message_0008_0000_0000$$$::"Okay, Saber. For now, I'll..."[lr]::
1681::$$$message_0008_0000_0001$$$::"Yes, I'll change right away, so could you wait here, Shirou?"[lr]::
1682::$$$message_0008_0000_0002$$$::"Huh!? Right here!?"::
1683::$$$message_0008_0001_0000$$$::"Yes. I'll be done right away.[lr]::
1684::$$$message_0008_0001_0001$$$::I have a feeling that once you leave, you'll find some reason to avoid me..."[lr]::
1685::$$$message_0008_0001_0002$$$::"N-no I won't."[lr]::
1686::$$$message_0008_0001_0003$$$::"Please stay,"::
1687::$$$message_0008_0002_0000$$$::...she insists. Actually, it's pretty unlike Saber to make such a fuss over changing clothes.::
1688::$$$message_0008_0003_0000$$$::"Sh-Shirou...!"[lr]::
1689::$$$message_0008_0003_0001$$$::"W-what?"::
1690::$$$message_0008_0004_0000$$$::"My ribbon came loose...[lr]::
1691::$$$message_0008_0004_0001$$$::Do you know where it's supposed to go?"[lr]::
1692::$$$message_0008_0004_0002$$$::"A ribbon!? How am I supposed to know!?"::
1693::$$$message_0008_0005_0000$$$::"Don't be like that. I just want you to look..."[lr]::
1694::$$$message_0008_0005_0001$$$::"I can't do it!"::
1695::$$$message_0008_0006_0000$$$::"Gah, I can't take this![lr]::
1696::$$$message_0008_0006_0001$$$::Look, just put something on... Th-that's right!"::
1697::$$$message_0008_0007_0000$$$::"Saber, put your armor on."[lr]::
1698::$$$message_0008_0007_0001$$$::"Eh...? Why? There's no enemy to fight here."[lr]::
1699::$$$message_0008_0007_0002$$$::"Just wear something..."::
1700::$$$message_0008_0008_0000$$$::"...Will this do?"[lr]::
1701::$$$message_0008_0008_0001$$$::"...Ahhh...thank god."[lr]::
1702::$$$message_0008_0008_0002$$$::My tension drains out of me all at once, and I want to slump to the ground.::
1703::$$$message_0008_0009_0000$$$::"...Shirou?"[lr]::
1704::$$$message_0008_0009_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
1705::$$$message_0008_0009_0002$$$::"I suppose this battle garb suits me after all."::
1706::$$$message_0008_0010_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
1707::$$$message_0008_0010_0001$$$::"This is what I've always been.[lr]::
1708::$$$message_0008_0010_0002$$$::I was never meant to wear splendor such as swimsuits and dresses..."::
1709::$$$message_0008_0011_0000$$$::"H-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]hold on!"[lr]::
1710::$$$message_0008_0011_0001$$$::"No, don't try to comfort me.[lr]::
1711::$$$message_0008_0011_0002$$$::After seeing your consternation and subsequent relief, it's as plain as day to me."::
1712::$$$message_0008_0012_0000$$$::"You're misunderstanding. Anyone would panic seeing you nude!"[lr]::
1713::$$$message_0008_0012_0001$$$::"Is that so? I don't..."::
1714::$$$message_0008_0013_0000$$$::Her not knowing how she looks to others has me dumbstruck.[lr]::
1715::$$$message_0008_0013_0001$$$::Damn it, what can I say to appease her?::
1716::$$$message_0008_0014_0000$$$::[font italic=1]"Hmm hm hmm, oh yay, Big Brother is watching us, Big Brother is listening to us~"[rf]::
1717::$$$message_0008_0015_0000$$$::...What the heck is that humming?[lr]::
1718::$$$message_0008_0015_0001$$$::Wait. The only person who would hum something like this is obviously...[lr]::
1719::$$$message_0008_0015_0002$$$::"It's Taiga. She's on her way here."[lr]::
1720::$$$message_0008_0015_0003$$$::"Wha..."::
1721::$$$message_0008_0016_0000$$$::[font italic=1]"We're all sons of Big Brother, so we love Big Brother, but we all know that the night we talk about our love, a black car will come~"[rf]::
1722::$$$message_0008_0017_0000$$$::"S-S-Saber! Your outfit!"[lr]::
1723::$$$message_0008_0017_0001$$$::"Yes...? [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧08a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバー鎧08a(中)]Oh no, she can't see me like this!"::
1724::$$$message_0008_0018_0000$$$::[font italic=1]"We'll all go to jail, and we learned in the gray walls, that we're all human, we're not Big Brother's sons, but..."[rf]::
1725::$$$message_0008_0019_0000$$$::"Saber! Hide in here!"[lr]::
1726::$$$message_0008_0019_0001$$$::I shove Saber into the closet.[lr]::
1727::$$$message_0008_0019_0002$$$::"Shirou!?"::
1728::$$$message_0008_0020_0000$$$::"Oh no oh no, rats, stop the rats, rats rats! Oh no! Rats![lr]::
1729::$$$message_0008_0020_0001$$$::Saber, are you here!?"::
1730::$$$message_0008_0021_0000$$$::"...Huh? Shirou?"[lr]::
1731::$$$message_0008_0021_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Hey. Saber isn't here."[lr]::
1732::$$$message_0008_0021_0002$$$::My nervous voice nearly cracks.::
1733::$$$message_0008_0022_0000$$$::"Really? I wanted to talk to her about shopping today.[lr]::
1734::$$$message_0008_0022_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=藤05b(中) time=300]You seem to think we just go on an epic adventure trying food around town, though."[lr]::
1735::$$$message_0008_0022_0002$$$::"Uh-huh. But isn't that nice to do once in a while?"::
1736::$$$message_0008_0023_0000$$$::"Ooh. You're suddenly way more understanding than before.[lr]::
1737::$$$message_0008_0023_0001$$$::Good boy, you've grown up so much in the last thirty minutes [humming]"[lr]::
1738::$$$message_0008_0023_0002$$$::"Yeah. That's why you have to keep a close eye on boys.[lr]::
1739::$$$message_0008_0023_0003$$$::Anyway, just go back to the living room."::
1740::$$$message_0008_0024_0000$$$::"Ah ha ha, I will if you demand it.[lr]::
1741::$$$message_0008_0024_0001$$$::But what are you doing in Saber's room?"::
1742::$$$message_0008_0025_0000$$$::...Damn, I can't talk my way out of it.[lr]::
1743::$$$message_0008_0025_0001$$$::I thought I had a chance against Fuji-nee, though!::
1744::$$$message_0008_0026_0000$$$::"Uh, well, I came to bring Saber tea.[lr]::
1745::$$$message_0008_0026_0001$$$::I wonder where she went... Oh, why don't you go check the dojo?"[lr]::
1746::$$$message_0008_0026_0002$$$::"You brought her tea and chocolates, huh..."::
1747::$$$message_0008_0027_0000$$$::...She ignored me.[lr]::
1748::$$$message_0008_0027_0001$$$::Oh, wait. What's that saying about turning disaster into fortune?[lr]::
1749::$$$message_0008_0027_0002$$$::I have this secret stash of chocolate truffles. That's a limited Noble Phantasm that's plenty strong enough to distract Fuji-nee...!::
1750::$$$message_0008_0028_0000$$$::"I know, why don't we have tea?[lr]::
1751::$$$message_0008_0028_0001$$$::If we have tea on the veranda, the chocolate might lure Saber out."[lr]::
1752::$$$message_0008_0028_0002$$$::"..."::
1753::$$$message_0008_0029_0000$$$::Fuji-nee peers into the room.[lr]::
1754::$$$message_0008_0029_0001$$$::I follow her gaze...[lr]::
1755::$$$message_0008_0029_0002$$$::The tray on the table, an opened paper bag on the floor, and Saber's neatly folded clothes in the corner of the room.::
1756::$$$message_0008_0030_0000$$$::"!!!!!!!!!"::
1757::$$$message_0008_0031_0000$$$::"...Shirou?"[lr]::
1758::$$$message_0008_0031_0001$$$::A smoking gun, so to speak.[lr]::
1759::$$$message_0008_0031_0002$$$::Ahh...I wish I had anemia so I could faint right now...::
1760::$$$message_0008_0032_0000$$$::"My big sisterly eye spies the clothes Saber was just wearing."[lr]::
1761::$$$message_0008_0032_0001$$$::"Y-yeah?[lr]::
1762::$$$message_0008_0032_0002$$$::Maybe she has multiple sets of the hand-me-downs from Tohsaka because she likes them..."::
1763::$$$message_0008_0033_0000$$$::"Nope. They're still warm, which means she just took them off.[lr]::
1764::$$$message_0008_0033_0001$$$::Why did Saber change clothes?"[lr]::
1765::$$$message_0008_0033_0002$$$::"M-[wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]maybe she's taking a bath?"[lr]::
1766::$$$message_0008_0033_0003$$$::"She went to the bath naked?"[lr]::
1767::$$$message_0008_0033_0004$$$::"Umm, uhh..."::
1768::$$$message_0008_0034_0000$$$::"She's in this room, isn't she?"[lr]::
1769::$$$message_0008_0034_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
1770::$$$message_0008_0034_0002$$$::"SHIIIIIIROOOOOOOU!!!"[rf]::
1771::$$$message_0008_0035_0000$$$::"Y-you're going to disturb the neighbors!"[lr]::
1772::$$$message_0008_0035_0001$$$::"Shaddup![lr]::
1773::$$$message_0008_0035_0002$$$::The neighbors are upstanding people, so they won't complain no matter how bad the noise is![lr]::
1774::$$$message_0008_0035_0003$$$::Not even if swords are clashing or fireworks are going off!"[lr]::
1775::$$$message_0008_0035_0004$$$::That's wonderful.[lr]::
1776::$$$message_0008_0035_0005$$$::They must be as good at minding their own business as city people.::
1777::$$$message_0008_0036_0000$$$::"No, I bet they just gave up because you never stop making weird noises!"[lr]::
1778::$$$message_0008_0036_0001$$$::"Don't try to dodge the question![lr]::
1779::$$$message_0008_0036_0002$$$::Impure sexual acts spotted![lr]::
1780::$$$message_0008_0036_0003$$$::Come along quietly!"[lr]::
1781::$$$message_0008_0036_0004$$$::"I just brought her tea! You're getting the wrong idea!"::
1782::$$$message_0008_0037_0000$$$::"Wrong idea, shmong idea!!![lr]::
1783::$$$message_0008_0037_0001$$$::You hatched some dirty scheme to make Saber take off her clothes, [cacheimage storage=藤05b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤05b(中)]but I, servant of justice, showed up, [cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤10b(中)]and you went, 'I got it!' and stuffed Saber into the closet! [cacheimage storage=white,藤07a頬腕b(中),i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋][wvl][fadein time=100 storage=white][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=3][se storage=se106.wav][rep fliplr=0 storages=藤07a頬腕b(中) time=800 flipud=0 poss=c bg=i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋 indexes=1000]It's been obvious to me for the last one minute and twenty seconds...!"::
1784::$$$message_0008_0038_0000$$$::Wrong! That's all wrong, except you are right about the closet![lr]::
1785::$$$message_0008_0038_0001$$$::Also, what's with the oddly specific amount of time!?::
1786::$$$message_0008_0039_0000$$$::"Anyway, I'm going to check the closet.[lr]::
1787::$$$message_0008_0039_0001$$$::Eeehehehe. I hope you're ready for this, Shirou."[lr]::
1788::$$$message_0008_0039_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
1789::$$$message_0008_0039_0003$$$::Ready for what?[lr]::
1790::$$$message_0008_0039_0004$$$::Urgh, I wish I could just vaniiiish...::
1791::$$$message_0008_0040_0000$$$::"It's okay now, Saber!"[lr]::
1792::$$$message_0008_0040_0001$$$::A normal Servant would just dematerialize.[lr]::
1793::$$$message_0008_0040_0002$$$::But Saber can't turn into spirit form, so...::
1794::$$$message_0008_0041_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
1795::$$$message_0008_0041_0001$$$::Argh, I'm finish[line len=2][lr]::
1796::$$$message_0008_0041_0002$$$::That works too.::
1797::$$$message_0008_0042_0000$$$::"Apologies, I dozed off.[lr]::
1798::$$$message_0008_0042_0001$$$::What happened, Taiga?"[lr]::
1799::$$$message_0008_0042_0002$$$::"This voice... Is that you, Saber?"::
1800::$$$message_0008_0043_0000$$$::"What are you doing in the closet with a raincoat on?"[lr]::
1801::$$$message_0008_0043_0001$$$::"Heh... Sometimes I'm in the mood for it."[lr]::
1802::$$$message_0008_0043_0002$$$::What mood is that?::
1803::$$$message_0008_0044_0000$$$::"O-ohhh, there you are, Saber.[lr]::
1804::$$$message_0008_0044_0001$$$::Ha ha ha. I totally didn't notice."[lr]::
1805::$$$message_0008_0044_0002$$$::"Mm-hmm, I see..."::
1806::$$$message_0008_0045_0000$$$::"You were so embarrassed you hid from Shirou? Oh Saber, you're such a maiden!"[lr]::
1807::$$$message_0008_0045_0001$$$::"What...?"[lr]::
1808::$$$message_0008_0045_0002$$$::"But I like that innocent side of you."[lr]::
1809::$$$message_0008_0045_0003$$$::"W-what are you talking about, Fuji-nee?"::
1810::$$$message_0008_0046_0000$$$::"Then it's time to show it off to him![lr]::
1811::$$$message_0008_0046_0001$$$::Shirou's bound to be interested in my sisterly opinion! [cacheimage storage=藤06a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤06a(中)]Go ahead, Saber!"::
1812::$$$message_0008_0047_0000$$$::"I refuse."[lr]::
1813::$$$message_0008_0047_0001$$$::"Oh come now, Saber!"::
1814::$$$message_0008_0048_0000$$$::"Looks like I will have to use force."[lr]::
1815::$$$message_0008_0048_0001$$$::"Please don't. You're well aware that you're no match for me, Taiga."[lr]::
1816::$$$message_0008_0048_0002$$$::Saber's gaze asks me what to do next.::
1817::$$$message_0008_0049_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
1818::$$$message_0008_0049_0001$$$::It's a hard choice.[lr]::
1819::$$$message_0008_0049_0002$$$::But we can't let Fuji-nee find out who Saber really is.[lr]::
1820::$$$message_0008_0049_0003$$$::This is for her sake, too.[lr]::
1821::$$$message_0008_0049_0004$$$::So I make a "go" sign at her, telling her it's okay.::
1822::$$$message_0008_0050_0000$$$::"Yaaaaaah!"[lr]::
1823::$$$message_0008_0050_0001$$$::With a burst of effort, Fuji-nee lunges at Saber![lr]::
1824::$$$message_0008_0050_0002$$$::"Please forgive me, Taiga."::
1825::$$$message_0008_0051_0000$$$::The two of them jostle around the cramped room.[lr]::
1826::$$$message_0008_0051_0001$$$::Saber has the overwhelming advantage in fighting strength, but...::
1827::$$$message_0008_0052_0000$$$::"Hehehe. You underestimate me, Saber![lr]::
1828::$$$message_0008_0052_0001$$$::Take this! Fujimura Style DOA technique!"::
1829::$$$message_0008_0053_0000$$$::"Umm, Secret Truffle Throw!"[lr]::
1830::$$$message_0008_0053_0001$$$::A black lump traces a parabola through the air.[lr]::
1831::$$$message_0008_0053_0002$$$::Is that one of the chocolate truffles!?::
1832::$$$message_0008_0054_0000$$$::"Nnn!"[lr]::
1833::$$$message_0008_0054_0001$$$::Overly superior physical abilities and vision are her downfall.[lr]::
1834::$$$message_0008_0054_0002$$$::Saber unwittingly chases after the chocolate.::
1835::$$$message_0008_0055_0000$$$::"You're open! HIIIYAAA!"::
1836::$$$message_0008_0056_0000$$$::"Ah[line len=2]!"[lr]::
1837::$$$message_0008_0056_0001$$$::...It's over.::
1838::$$$message_0008_0057_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
1839::$$$message_0008_0057_0001$$$::"Why are you wasting food, Taiga!?"[lr]::
1840::$$$message_0008_0057_0002$$$::Saber, hurry up and notice.[lr]::
1841::$$$message_0008_0057_0003$$$::Now, how am I going to explain the armor to Fuji-nee... Yeah, no. I can't think of anything.::
1842::$$$message_0008_0058_0000$$$::"Saber, you were wearing something like that?"[lr]::
1843::$$$message_0008_0058_0001$$$::"What do you mean 'that'[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧06b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバー鎧06b(中)]!!![cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧10c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧10c(中)]..."::
1844::$$$message_0008_0059_0000$$$::"...Um, Fuji-nee. That is, er..."[lr]::
1845::$$$message_0008_0059_0001$$$::"Hmmm. I guess you would be embarrassed to be seen like that by Shirou. [cacheimage storage=藤08a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=藤08a(中) time=300]I see, I see."[lr]::
1846::$$$message_0008_0059_0002$$$::Huh?::
1847::$$$message_0008_0060_0000$$$::"Fuji-nee...you aren't surprised?"[lr]::
1848::$$$message_0008_0060_0001$$$::"Why?"[lr]::
1849::$$$message_0008_0060_0002$$$::"Well...it's armor.[lr]::
1850::$$$message_0008_0060_0003$$$::Plate mail, at that."[lr]::
1851::$$$message_0008_0060_0004$$$::"Mm-hm. Excellent cosplay, I must say."::
1852::$$$message_0008_0061_0000$$$::"Cos...play...?"[lr]::
1853::$$$message_0008_0061_0001$$$::"Ah..."::
1854::$$$message_0008_0062_0000$$$::"You see it on the news sometimes.[lr]::
1855::$$$message_0008_0062_0001$$$::This must be one of those cosplays that's trending these days."[lr]::
1856::$$$message_0008_0062_0002$$$::It's a peaceful idea that only a peaceful person from a peaceful country would have.[lr]::
1857::$$$message_0008_0062_0003$$$::Isn't peace a wonderful thing?::
1858::$$$message_0008_0063_0000$$$::"R...[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]right, that's it! It's cosplay![lr]::
1859::$$$message_0008_0063_0001$$$::I-i-isn't it well made?"[lr]::
1860::$$$message_0008_0063_0002$$$::"Seriously. All the way to using real metal."[lr]::
1861::$$$message_0008_0063_0003$$$::"A lot of attention has been put into the details!"[lr]::
1862::$$$message_0008_0063_0004$$$::"Do we even have a craftsman skilled enough to make this in Fuyuki?"[lr]::
1863::$$$message_0008_0063_0005$$$::"I made it! [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]In the shed!"::
1864::$$$message_0008_0064_0000$$$::"Makes sense. You're good enough with your hands, and you're patient, too."[lr]::
1865::$$$message_0008_0064_0001$$$::"It was hard. There were a bunch of times I almost gave up."[lr]::
1866::$$$message_0008_0064_0002$$$::"That's remarkable! I'm proud of you as your guardian.[lr]::
1867::$$$message_0008_0064_0003$$$::By the way, why'd you work so hard on it?"[lr]::
1868::$$$message_0008_0064_0004$$$::"It's um...something they asked for in the cultural festival."::
1869::$$$message_0008_0065_0000$$$::"That's gotta be a lie."[lr]::
1870::$$$message_0008_0065_0001$$$::"Nn!?"::
1871::$$$message_0008_0066_0000$$$::"I mean, Saber, you've always worn that."[lr]::
1872::$$$message_0008_0066_0001$$$::...What?::
1873::$$$message_0008_0067_0000$$$::"W-when did I wear this in front of you...?"[lr]::
1874::$$$message_0008_0067_0001$$$::"When you watch historical dramas at lunch, or when you're playing video games.[lr]::
1875::$$$message_0008_0067_0002$$$::[chgfg storage=藤04a(中) time=300]It's like your competition clothes you put on when you get really into something."::
1876::$$$message_0008_0068_0000$$$::So, um...[lr]::
1877::$$$message_0008_0068_0001$$$::Saber's been getting carried away and transforming without even realizing it...::
1878::$$$message_0008_0069_0000$$$::"Yeah. And I think it looks good on you.[lr]::
1879::$$$message_0008_0069_0001$$$::But girls need to look cute, too.[lr]::
1880::$$$message_0008_0069_0002$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=藤10a(中) time=300]You went to the trouble of buying a swimsuit, after all."[lr]::
1881::$$$message_0008_0069_0003$$$::"...Yes."::
1882::$$$message_0008_0070_0000$$$::"Make sure you keep her company when the time comes, Shirou.[lr]::
1883::$$$message_0008_0070_0001$$$::Even Saber would be bothered if you're [font italic=true]too[font italic=false] much of a late bloomer."[lr]::
1884::$$$message_0008_0070_0002$$$::"...Yes, ma'am."::
1885::$$$message_0008_0071_0000$$$::Saber and I get lectured together.[lr]::
1886::$$$message_0008_0071_0001$$$::Anyway, we escaped disaster and avoided a misunderstanding...by covering it up with an even stranger one.::
1887::$$$message_0008_0072_0000$$$::"Nowww, I beat Saber at something for once, and I'm in a good mood.[lr]::
1888::$$$message_0008_0072_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=藤06a(中) time=300]Ah, Shirou, I'm taking the tea and chocolates!"[lr]::
1889::$$$message_0008_0072_0002$$$::"...Sure."::
1890::$$$message_0008_0073_0000$$$::Fuji-nee cheerfully grabs a teacup.[lr]::
1891::$$$message_0008_0073_0001$$$::All we can do is watch as she makes off with all the chocolate truffles.::
1892::$$$message_0008_0074_0000$$$::"Hmm, cosplay, huh... I wonder if it's also trending in this house..."[lr]::
1893::$$$message_0008_0074_0001$$$::"..."::
1894::$$$message_0008_0075_0000$$$::"Sometimes I see Sakura wearing black pajamas with red stripes, and Rider has that tight purple one-piece.[lr]::
1895::$$$message_0008_0075_0001$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=藤08d(遠) time=300]Maybe I should come up with something too... What would look good... Maybe that masked character..."::
1896::$$$message_0008_0076_0000$$$::"...Shirou."[lr]::
1897::$$$message_0008_0076_0001$$$::"Ahh... It's like a tic, right? It can't be helped."[lr]::
1898::$$$message_0008_0076_0002$$$::"Yes, I'll be careful from now on..."::
1899::$$$message_0008_0077_0000$$$::"Don't beat yourself up about it.[lr]::
1900::$$$message_0008_0077_0001$$$::Oh right, so about that swimsuit..."[lr]::
1901::$$$message_0008_0077_0002$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
1902::$$$message_0008_0077_0003$$$::"There's a more appropriate place to show me than here, right?[lr]::
1903::$$$message_0008_0077_0004$$$::Want to go to the pool in Shinto next time?"::
1904::$$$message_0008_0078_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
1905::$$$message_0008_0078_0001$$$::This isn't really like me.[lr]::
1906::$$$message_0008_0078_0002$$$::I blurt it out, and then scratch my cheek after the fact.::
1907::$$$message_0008_0079_0000$$$::"Well, uh, I heard there was a new pool in Shinto, so..."[lr]::
1908::$$$message_0008_0079_0001$$$::It's quiet for a moment.[lr]::
1909::$$$message_0008_0079_0002$$$::Saber inhales slightly.::
1910::$$$message_0008_0080_0000$$$::"Yes. I'd be happy to accompany you."[lr]::
1911::$$$message_0008_0080_0001$$$::And just like that, she accepts my invitation.::
901800::$$$message_9008_0043_0000$$$::"What are you doing in the closet with a raincoat on?"[r]::

